  "description": "Estimated async replication CDC flow for one database, before changefeeds exist. Every flow is bytes or rows per minute. The aggregation interval only sets the rate() window.",
  "editable": true,
  "fiscalYearStartMonth": 0,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "links": [],
  "liveNow": false,
  "panels": [
    {
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "id": 1,
      "options": {
        "content": "Estimate of the CDC stream async replication would produce for every row table in the selected database. Changefeeds are not required.\n\nCounters are leader DataShard engine metrics. `EngineHostRowUpdateBytes` is the size of the key and of the cells the engine wrote. `EngineHostRowEraseBytes` is the key size plus 8 bytes per delete; those 8 bytes are subtracted below. Reads, compaction, and follower series are not included.\n\n**Unit.** Each series is `rate(counter[$agg]) * 60`. `$agg` only smooths the rate. A longer interval does not turn the value into bytes per that interval: it stays bytes, or rows, per minute.\n\n**Write and read.** In `UPDATES` mode the topic record is those same cells. For `BINARY` the topic write and the consumer read of that payload are this value (zstd and the 8-byte header stay inside the uncertainty). The read line adds 70 bytes of Topic API metadata per record. For `JSON` the payload line is a lower bound: column names are not in the counters.",
        "mode": "markdown"
      },
      "title": "What is counted",
      "type": "text"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "$ds"
      },
      "description": "Mean, over the dashboard time range, of cell bytes per minute. This is the BINARY topic payload and the lower bound for JSON.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "decimals": 1,
          "min": 0,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "blue",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          },
          "unit": "decbytes"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 5
      },
      "id": 2,
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "orientation": "auto",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "mean"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "textMode": "auto"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "$ds"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "clamp_min(\n  (sum(rate(tablets_DataShard_EngineHostRowUpdateBytes{database=\"$database\"}[$agg])) or vector(0))\n  + (sum(rate(tablets_DataShard_EngineHostRowEraseBytes{database=\"$database\"}[$agg])) or vector(0))\n  - 8 * (sum(rate(tablets_DataShard_EngineHostRowErases{database=\"$database\"}[$agg])) or vector(0)),\n  0\n) * 60",
          "legendFormat": "payload",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Payload, bytes per minute",
      "type": "stat"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "$ds"
      },
      "description": "Mean, over the dashboard time range, of row changes per minute. One CDC record per update or delete.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "decimals": 1,
          "min": 0,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "blue",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          },
          "unit": "short"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 8,
        "y": 5
      },
      "id": 3,
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "orientation": "auto",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "mean"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "textMode": "auto"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "$ds"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "(\n  (sum(rate(tablets_DataShard_EngineHostRowUpdates{database=\"$database\"}[$agg])) or vector(0))\n  + (sum(rate(tablets_DataShard_EngineHostRowErases{database=\"$database\"}[$agg])) or vector(0))\n) * 60",
          "legendFormat": "records",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Records per minute",
      "type": "stat"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
